{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "local_live_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read current values through LocalDevVPN without a computer, while MochiLog is open. Log collection uses a separate connection. No history is saved. Enable on-device collection to use this route."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LocalDevVPN経由でPCを介さず現在値を取得します。MochiLogを開いている間、ログ収集とは別接続で更新し、履歴には保存しません。この経路を使うには端末内取得をオンにしてください。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktuelle Werte über LocalDevVPN ohne Computer, bei geöffneter App. Protokolle nutzen eine separate Verbindung. Kein Verlauf. Erfassung auf dem Gerät aktivieren."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Valores actuales mediante LocalDevVPN sin ordenador, con MochiLog abierto. Los registros usan otra conexión. Sin historial. Activa la recopilación en el dispositivo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Valeurs actuelles via LocalDevVPN sans ordinateur, app ouverte. Journaux sur connexion distincte. Aucun historique. Activez la collecte sur l’appareil."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"앱이 열린 동안 LocalDevVPN으로 PC 없이 현재 값을 가져옵니다. 로그와 별도 연결로 갱신하며 기록으로 저장하지 않습니다. 기기 내 수집을 켜세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"应用打开时通过LocalDevVPN获取当前值，无需电脑。日志采集使用独立连接，不保存历史。请开启设备内采集。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App開啟時透過LocalDevVPN取得目前值，無需電腦。日誌擷取使用獨立連線，不儲存歷史。請開啟裝置內擷取。"}}}},
    "local_live_enable": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Show the Live Battery tab"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"現在のバッテリータブを表示"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tab „Aktueller Akku“ anzeigen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mostrar pestaña Batería actual"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Afficher l’onglet Batterie actuelle"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"현재 배터리 탭 표시"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"显示当前电池标签页"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"顯示目前電池標籤頁"}}}},
    "local_pair_title": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pair on this device"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この端末だけでペアリング"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Auf diesem Gerät koppeln"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Emparejar en este dispositivo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jumeler sur cet appareil"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 기기에서 페어링"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在此设备上配对"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在此裝置上配對"}}}},
    "local_pair_start": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Start on-device pairing"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"端末内ペアリングを開始"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gerätekopplung starten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Iniciar emparejamiento local"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Démarrer le jumelage local"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기기 내 페어링 시작"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"开始设备内配对"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開始裝置內配對"}}}},
    "local_pair_instructions": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Start pairing and allow Local Network.\n2. In Settings → Privacy & Security → Developer Mode, select the MochiLog host shown below and authorize with your device passcode.\n3. Enter the six-digit code shown in the task banner or notification, then return to MochiLog. Enable Developer Mode if the OS requires it."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. 開始してローカルネットワークを許可します。\n2. 設定 → プライバシーとセキュリティ → デベロッパモードで、下に表示されたMochiLogの名前を選び、端末のパスコードで承認します。\n3. タスクのバナーまたは通知に出る6桁コードを入力し、MochiLogへ戻ります。OSが求める場合はデベロッパモードをオンにしてください。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Starten und lokalen Netzwerkzugriff erlauben.\n2. Einstellungen → Datenschutz & Sicherheit → Entwicklermodus: den unten angezeigten MochiLog-Host wählen und mit dem Gerätecode bestätigen.\n3. Den sechsstelligen Code aus dem Aufgabenbanner oder der Mitteilung eingeben und zu MochiLog zurückkehren. Entwicklermodus einschalten, falls iOS es verlangt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Inicia y permite Red local.\n2. Ajustes → Privacidad y seguridad → Modo de desarrollador: elige el host MochiLog mostrado abajo y autoriza con el código del dispositivo.\n3. Introduce los seis dígitos del banner o la notificación y vuelve a MochiLog. Activa el modo de desarrollador si iOS lo solicita."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Démarrez et autorisez Réseau local.\n2. Réglages → Confidentialité et sécurité → Mode développeur : choisissez l’hôte MochiLog indiqué ci-dessous, puis autorisez avec le code de l’appareil.\n3. Saisissez les six chiffres de la bannière ou notification et revenez dans MochiLog. Activez le mode développeur si iOS le demande."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. 시작하고 로컬 네트워크를 허용하세요.\n2. 설정 → 개인정보 보호 및 보안 → 개발자 모드에서 아래에 표시된 MochiLog 호스트를 선택하고 기기 암호로 승인하세요.\n3. 작업 배너나 알림의 6자리 코드를 입력하고 MochiLog로 돌아오세요. OS에서 요구하면 개발자 모드를 켜세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. 开始并允许本地网络。\n2. 设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 开发者模式，选择下方显示的MochiLog主机，输入设备密码授权。\n3. 输入任务横幅或通知中的六位验证码，然后返回MochiLog。如系统要求，请开启开发者模式。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. 開始並允許區域網路。\n2. 設定 → 隱私權與安全性 → 開發者模式，選擇下方顯示的MochiLog主機，輸入裝置密碼授權。\n3. 輸入任務橫幅或通知中的六位驗證碼，然後返回MochiLog。如系統要求，請開啟開發者模式。"}}}},
    "local_pair_ready": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ready to pair"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ペアリングを開始できます"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bereit zur Kopplung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Listo para emparejar"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prêt au jumelage"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"페어링 준비 완료"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可以开始配对"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可以開始配對"}}}},
    "local_pair_preparing": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preparing pairing"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ペアリングを準備中"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopplung wird vorbereitet"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Preparando emparejamiento"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Préparation du jumelage"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"페어링 준비 중"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在准备配对"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在準備配對"}}}},
    "local_pair_waiting": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Waiting for approval in Settings"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定での承認を待っています"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Warte auf Bestätigung in den Einstellungen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esperando autorización en Ajustes"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"En attente d’autorisation dans Réglages"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설정에서 승인 대기 중"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"等待设置中的授权"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"等待設定中的授權"}}}},
    "local_pair_enter_code": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enter the code in Settings"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"設定に確認コードを入力してください"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Code in den Einstellungen eingeben"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Introduce el código en Ajustes"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saisissez le code dans Réglages"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"설정에 확인 코드를 입력하세요"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请在设置中输入验证码"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"請在設定中輸入驗證碼"}}}},
    "local_pair_code": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Confirmation code"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"確認コード"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bestätigungscode"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Código de confirmación"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Code de confirmation"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"확인 코드"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"验证码"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"驗證碼"}}}},
    "local_pair_complete": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OS pairing complete. Connect LocalDevVPN to collect."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OSペアリング完了。LocalDevVPNを接続すると取得できます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OS-Kopplung abgeschlossen. Zum Erfassen LocalDevVPN verbinden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Emparejamiento del sistema completado. Conecta LocalDevVPN para recopilar."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jumelage système terminé. Connectez LocalDevVPN pour collecter."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OS 페어링 완료. 수집하려면 LocalDevVPN을 연결하세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系统配对完成。连接LocalDevVPN后即可采集。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系統配對完成。連接LocalDevVPN後即可擷取。"}}}},
    "local_pair_failed": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pairing failed. Check Local Network access and the approval in Settings, then retry. Existing credentials were kept."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ペアリングできませんでした。ローカルネットワークの許可と設定での承認を確認し、再試行してください。既存の認証情報は保持しています。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopplung fehlgeschlagen. Netzwerkzugriff und Bestätigung in den Einstellungen prüfen. Bisherige Zugangsdaten bleiben erhalten."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se pudo emparejar. Revisa Red local y la autorización en Ajustes. Se conservaron las credenciales existentes."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Échec du jumelage. Vérifiez Réseau local et l’autorisation dans Réglages. Les identifiants existants sont conservés."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"페어링 실패. 로컬 네트워크 허용과 설정의 승인을 확인하세요. 기존 인증 정보는 유지됩니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配对失败。请检查本地网络权限和设置中的授权。已保留原凭据。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配對失敗。請檢查區域網路權限和設定中的授權。已保留原憑證。"}}}},
    "local_pair_expired": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pairing expired or was stopped by iOS. Return here and start again."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"時間切れ、またはiOSが処理を停止しました。ここへ戻って開始し直してください。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zeit abgelaufen oder von iOS gestoppt. Hier erneut starten."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tiempo agotado o proceso detenido por iOS. Vuelve e inicia otra vez."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Délai dépassé ou arrêt par iOS. Revenez et recommencez."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시간 초과 또는 iOS가 중지했습니다. 돌아와 다시 시작하세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已超时或被iOS停止。请返回并重新开始。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已逾時或被iOS停止。請返回並重新開始。"}}}},
    "local_pair_cancelled": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pairing cancelled"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ペアリングを中止しました"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopplung abgebrochen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Emparejamiento cancelado"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jumelage annulé"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"페어링 취소됨"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配对已取消"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配對已取消"}}}},
    "local_pair_short_background": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iOS only granted a short background window. Complete approval promptly; if it stops, return and retry."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iOSが許可したバックグラウンド時間が短いため、速やかに承認してください。止まった場合は戻って再試行できます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iOS erlaubt nur kurze Hintergrundzeit. Zügig bestätigen; bei Abbruch zurückkehren und erneut versuchen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iOS concedió poco tiempo en segundo plano. Autoriza pronto; si se detiene, vuelve y reintenta."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iOS a accordé peu de temps en arrière-plan. Autorisez rapidement ; en cas d’arrêt, revenez et réessayez."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iOS가 허용한 백그라운드 시간이 짧습니다. 빨리 승인하고 중지되면 돌아와 재시도하세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iOS仅允许较短的后台时间。请尽快授权；如停止，可返回重试。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iOS僅允許較短的背景時間。請儘快授權；如停止，可返回重試。"}}}},
    "local_pair_replace_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A successful pairing replaces only this app’s on-device credential. Existing PC pairings and records remain. Cancel or failure keeps the current credential."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成功した場合だけ、このアプリの端末内取得用の認証情報を置き換えます。既存のPCペアリングと記録は保持します。中止・失敗なら現在の認証情報を残します。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nur eine erfolgreiche Kopplung ersetzt den Gerätezugang dieser App. PC-Kopplungen und Aufzeichnungen bleiben erhalten. Abbruch oder Fehler behalten den bisherigen Zugang."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Solo un emparejamiento correcto reemplaza la credencial local de esta app. Se conservan los PC y registros. Cancelar o fallar mantiene la credencial actual."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seul un jumelage réussi remplace l’accès local de cette app. Les PC et enregistrements sont conservés. Annulation ou échec garde l’accès actuel."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"성공한 경우에만 이 앱의 기기 내 인증 정보를 교체합니다. PC 페어링과 기록은 유지됩니다. 취소 또는 실패 시 기존 인증 정보를 유지합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只有成功配对才替换此应用的设备内凭据。现有电脑配对和记录保持不变。取消或失败时保留当前凭据。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只有成功配對才取代此App的裝置內憑證。現有電腦配對和記錄保持不變。取消或失敗時保留目前憑證。"}}}},
    "update_optin_title": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatically check for updates?"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アップデートを自動確認しますか？"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatisch nach Updates suchen?"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¿Buscar actualizaciones automáticamente?"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rechercher automatiquement les mises à jour ?"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"업데이트를 자동으로 확인할까요?"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动检查更新？"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動檢查更新？"}}}},
    "update_optin_yes": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Enable automatic checks"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動確認をオンにする"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatische Suche aktivieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activar comprobaciones"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Activer la recherche"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"자동 확인 켜기"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"开启自动检查"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟自動檢查"}}}},
    "update_optin_no": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keep off"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"オフのまま使う"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Deaktiviert lassen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mantener desactivado"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Laisser désactivé"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"끄기 유지"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保持关闭"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保持關閉"}}}},
    "update_optin_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Checks GitHub for new versions while the app is running. Installing an update requires your confirmation. You can change this in Settings; manual checks work while automatic checks are off."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"起動中にGitHubで新しいバージョンを確認します。インストールは確認後に行います。設定でいつでも変更でき、オフでも手動確認は使えます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sucht während der Ausführung auf GitHub. Installation nur nach Bestätigung. In den Einstellungen änderbar; manuelle Suche bleibt verfügbar."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Busca nuevas versiones en GitHub mientras la app está abierta. La instalación requiere confirmación. Se puede cambiar en Ajustes; la búsqueda manual sigue disponible."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recherche les versions sur GitHub lorsque l’app fonctionne. Installation après confirmation. Modifiable dans les réglages ; la recherche manuelle reste disponible."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"앱 실행 중 GitHub에서 새 버전을 확인합니다. 설치는 확인 후 진행합니다. 설정에서 변경할 수 있으며 수동 확인은 항상 가능합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"运行时在GitHub检查新版本，安装前需确认。可在设置中更改；关闭后仍可手动检查。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行時在GitHub檢查新版本，安裝前需確認。可在設定中變更；關閉後仍可手動檢查。"}}}},
    "auto_collection_title": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatic Log Collection"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動ログ収集"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatische Protokollerfassung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recopilación automática de registros"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collecte automatique des journaux"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"자동 로그 수집"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动日志收集"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動日誌收集"}}}},
    "auto_collection_intro": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collect daily battery logs with a computer, directly on this device, or both. Received files use one shared import queue, preserving device identities and avoiding duplicate records."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"毎日のバッテリーログをPC経由・端末内・両方のいずれでも取得できます。受け取ったファイルは共通の取り込み処理に集め、個体IDを保持して記録の重複を防ぎます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tägliche Akkuprotokolle über Computer, direkt auf dem Gerät oder beides. Eine gemeinsame Importwarteschlange erhält Geräte-IDs und verhindert doppelte Einträge."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Obtén registros diarios mediante un ordenador, en el dispositivo o ambos. Una cola común conserva las identidades y evita duplicados."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collectez les journaux via un ordinateur, sur cet appareil ou les deux. Une file commune conserve les identités et évite les doublons."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PC, 기기 자체 또는 둘 다로 매일 배터리 로그를 수집합니다. 공통 가져오기 대기열로 기기 ID를 유지하고 중복을 방지합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可通过电脑、设备自身或两者收集每日电池日志。共用导入队列保留设备身份并避免重复记录。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可透過電腦、裝置自身或兩者收集每日電池日誌。共用匯入佇列保留裝置身分並避免重複記錄。"}}}},
    "auto_pc_enable": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collect automatically with a computer"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PC経由で自動収集"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatisch über Computer erfassen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recopilar automáticamente con un ordenador"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collecter automatiquement via un ordinateur"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PC에서 자동 수집"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通过电脑自动收集"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"透過電腦自動收集"}}}},
    "auto_pc_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Turning this off stops automatic log reception, preserving pairings. Current battery readings remain independent."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"オフにするとログの自動受信を停止します。ペアリングは保持し、現在のバッテリー値の取得は独立して動作します。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aus stoppt den automatischen Protokollempfang. Kopplungen bleiben erhalten; aktuelle Akkuwerte arbeiten unabhängig."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Al desactivarlo se detiene la recepción automática. Se conserva el emparejamiento; los valores actuales funcionan por separado."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Désactivé : réception automatique arrêtée. Jumelages conservés ; valeurs actuelles indépendantes."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"끄면 자동 로그 수신을 중지합니다. 페어링은 유지하며 현재 배터리 값은 독립적으로 작동합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"关闭后停止自动接收日志，保留配对。当前电池值独立运行。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"關閉後停止自動接收日誌，保留配對。目前電池值獨立運作。"}}}},
    "auto_local_enable": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collect directly on this device (experimental)"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"端末内で取得（実験機能）"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Direkt auf diesem Gerät erfassen (experimentell)"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recopilar en este dispositivo (experimental)"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collecter sur cet appareil (expérimental)"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 기기에서 직접 수집 (실험 기능)"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在此设备直接获取（实验功能）"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在此裝置直接取得（實驗功能）"}}}},
    "auto_local_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uses an authenticated local diagnostic tunnel. Set up OS pairing and LocalDevVPN or a compatible reflector first. You can enable this independently of computer collection."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"認証済みの診断トンネルから取得します。先にOSペアリングとLocalDevVPNまたは対応するリフレクターを設定してください。PC経由の収集とは個別に切り替えられます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Benötigt OS-Kopplung und LocalDevVPN oder einen kompatiblen Reflektor. Unabhängig von der Computererfassung aktivierbar."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Requiere emparejamiento del sistema y LocalDevVPN o un reflector compatible. Se activa independientemente del ordenador."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nécessite un jumelage système et LocalDevVPN ou un réflecteur compatible. Activation indépendante de l’ordinateur."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OS 페어링과 LocalDevVPN 또는 호환 리플렉터가 필요합니다. PC 수집과 별도로 켤 수 있습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要系统配对和LocalDevVPN或兼容反射器。可与电脑收集分别开关。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要系統配對和LocalDevVPN或相容反射器。可與電腦收集分別開關。"}}}},
    "local_title": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-device collection · LocalDevVPN"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"端末内取得・LocalDevVPN"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geräteinterne Erfassung · LocalDevVPN"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recopilación local · LocalDevVPN"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collecte locale · LocalDevVPN"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기기 자체 수집 · LocalDevVPN"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设备内获取 · LocalDevVPN"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"裝置內取得 · LocalDevVPN"}}}},
    "local_intro": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Read this device’s daily battery logs and, when present, Apple Watch logs stored on it. After setup the computer does not relay these reads. Current battery values use a separate connection and are never saved as records."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この端末の毎日の電池ログと、保存されているApple Watchログを直接読み取ります。設定後の取得にPCの中継は使いません。現在のバッテリー値は別接続で取得し、記録としては保存しません。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Liest eigene tägliche Akku- und gespeicherte Watch-Protokolle. Nach Einrichtung ohne Computer-Relay. Aktuelle Werte über separate Verbindung, ohne Speicherung als Einträge."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lee los registros propios y los del Watch almacenados aquí. Tras configurar no usa el ordenador como intermediario. Los valores actuales usan otra conexión y no se guardan como registros."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lit les journaux propres et ceux de la Watch stockés ici. Après configuration, sans relais ordinateur. Valeurs actuelles sur connexion séparée, sans enregistrement."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 기기와 저장된 Watch의 일일 로그를 직접 읽습니다. 설정 후 PC 중계 없이 수집합니다. 현재 값은 별도 연결로 가져오며 기록으로 저장하지 않습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"直接读取本设备及存放于此的Watch每日日志。设置后无需电脑中转。当前值通过独立连接获取，不保存为记录。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"直接讀取本裝置及存放於此的Watch每日日誌。設定後無需電腦中轉。目前值透過獨立連線取得，不儲存為記錄。"}}}},
    "local_configured": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OS pairing saved on this device"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この端末にOSペアリングを保存済み"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OS-Kopplung auf diesem Gerät gespeichert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Emparejamiento del sistema guardado aquí"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jumelage système enregistré ici"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 기기에 OS 페어링 저장됨"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已在此设备保存系统配对"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已在此裝置儲存系統配對"}}}},
    "local_setup_needed": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"On-device setup needed"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"端末内取得の設定が必要です"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geräteeinrichtung erforderlich"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Se necesita configuración local"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Configuration locale nécessaire"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기기 자체 설정 필요"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要设备内设置"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要裝置內設定"}}}},
    "local_pairing_step": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 · Set up authentication"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 · 認証を設定"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 · Authentifizierung einrichten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 · Configurar autenticación"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 · Configurer l’authentification"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 · 인증 설정"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 · 设置认证"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1 · 設定認證"}}}},
    "local_pairing_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose on-device pairing below, or securely reuse this device’s OS credential from an updated paired computer. The MochiLog QR key alone is not OS diagnostic trust."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下の端末内ペアリングを使うか、更新済みのペアリング済みPCからこの端末のOS認証情報を暗号化して引き継げます。MochiLogのQR鍵だけではOS診断の信頼は作成されません。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unten auf dem Gerät koppeln oder den OS-Zugang dieses Geräts sicher vom aktualisierten gekoppelten PC übernehmen. Der QR-Schlüssel allein ist kein OS-Diagnosezugang."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Empareja aquí o reutiliza de forma segura la credencial del sistema de este dispositivo desde un PC actualizado y emparejado. La clave QR por sí sola no crea confianza del sistema."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jumelez ici ou reprenez de façon chiffrée l’accès système de cet appareil depuis un PC jumelé à jour. La clé QR seule ne crée pas la confiance système."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"아래에서 기기 내 페어링을 하거나 업데이트된 페어링 PC의 이 기기용 OS 인증을 암호화해 가져오세요. QR 키만으로 OS 신뢰가 생성되지는 않습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可在下方进行设备内配对，或从已更新且已配对的电脑加密复用此设备的系统凭据。QR密钥本身不建立系统诊断信任。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可在下方進行裝置內配對，或從已更新且已配對的電腦加密重用此裝置的系統憑證。QR金鑰本身不建立系統診斷信任。"}}}},
    "local_reuse": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Use existing OS pairing"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"既存のOSペアリングを引き継ぐ"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vorhandene OS-Kopplung verwenden"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usar emparejamiento existente"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Utiliser le jumelage existant"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기존 OS 페어링 사용"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用现有系统配对"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用現有系統配對"}}}},
    "local_reuse_failed": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Could not reuse the OS credential. Update the computer app and verify its own-device wireless diagnostics first. If it has no RemotePairing credential, complete initial USB trust and OS pairing in the computer app; QR pairing alone is insufficient."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OS認証情報を引き継げませんでした。PCアプリを更新し、この端末の無線診断接続を確認してください。RemotePairingの認証情報がない場合はPC側で初回USBの信頼とOSペアリングを完了します。QRだけでは診断サービスに接続できません。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OS-Zugang konnte nicht übernommen werden. Computer-App aktualisieren und Drahtlosdiagnose prüfen. Ohne RemotePairing zuerst USB-Vertrauen/OS-Kopplung am Computer abschließen; QR allein reicht nicht."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se pudo reutilizar. Actualiza la app del ordenador y comprueba el diagnóstico inalámbrico. Sin RemotePairing, completa confianza USB y emparejamiento del sistema; el QR no basta."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impossible de réutiliser l’accès. Mettez l’app ordinateur à jour et vérifiez le diagnostic sans fil. Sans RemotePairing, terminez la confiance USB et le jumelage système ; le QR seul ne suffit pas."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OS 인증을 가져오지 못했습니다. PC 앱을 업데이트하고 무선 진단을 확인하세요. RemotePairing이 없으면 PC에서 초기 USB 신뢰와 OS 페어링을 완료하세요. QR만으로는 부족합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法沿用系统凭据。请更新电脑应用并确认无线诊断。若无RemotePairing，请在电脑上完成首次USB信任与系统配对；只有QR不够。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法沿用系統憑證。請更新電腦應用並確認無線診斷。若無RemotePairing，請在電腦上完成首次USB信任與系統配對；只有QR不夠。"}}}},
    "local_import_title": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Use an existing pairing file instead"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手元のペアリングファイルを使う"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vorhandene Kopplungsdatei nutzen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Usar un archivo de emparejamiento"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Utiliser un fichier de jumelage"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기존 페어링 파일 사용"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用现有配对文件"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用現有配對檔案"}}}},
    "local_import_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Export this device’s RPPairing plist with idevice_pair and enter its UDID. Classic iTunes/Finder pairing files do not work. The file grants diagnostic access: keep it private and never send it to support. A device identity mismatch stops all reads."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"idevice_pairでこの端末のRPPairing形式plistを作成し、端末のUDIDを入力します。通常のiTunes/Finder形式では使えません。診断アクセス用の秘密を含むため公開・サポート送信はしないでください。接続先のUDIDが一致しなければ取得を停止します。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"RPPairing-plist dieses Geräts mit idevice_pair exportieren und UDID eingeben. iTunes/Finder-Dateien sind ungeeignet. Datei geheim halten, niemals an Support senden. Andere Geräte-ID stoppt das Lesen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exporta el plist RPPairing con idevice_pair e introduce el UDID. Los archivos iTunes/Finder no sirven. Mantén el archivo privado y no lo envíes a soporte. Una identidad distinta detiene la lectura."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exportez le plist RPPairing avec idevice_pair et saisissez l’UDID. Fichiers iTunes/Finder incompatibles. Gardez-le secret, sans envoi au support. Identité différente : lecture arrêtée."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"idevice_pair로 이 기기의 RPPairing plist를 만들고 UDID를 입력하세요. iTunes/Finder 파일은 지원하지 않습니다. 인증 파일은 비공개로 유지하고 지원에 보내지 마세요. ID 불일치 시 읽기를 중단합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用idevice_pair导出此设备的RPPairing plist并输入UDID。普通iTunes/Finder文件不适用。文件包含认证秘密，请勿公开或发送给支持。设备身份不符时停止读取。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用idevice_pair匯出此裝置的RPPairing plist並輸入UDID。一般iTunes/Finder檔案不適用。檔案包含認證秘密，請勿公開或傳送給支援。裝置身分不符時停止讀取。"}}}},
    "local_udid": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This device’s UDID"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この端末のUDID"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"UDID dieses Geräts"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"UDID de este dispositivo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"UDID de cet appareil"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 기기의 UDID"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此设备的UDID"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此裝置的UDID"}}}},
    "local_import_button": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Import pairing plist"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ペアリングplistを取り込む"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopplungs-plist importieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importar plist"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Importer le plist"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"페어링 plist 가져오기"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"导入配对plist"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"匯入配對plist"}}}},
    "local_import_failed": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Invalid RPPairing file or UDID. Use this device’s RPPairing plist containing identifier and 32-byte keys."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"RPPairingファイルまたはUDIDが正しくありません。この端末用のidentifierと32バイトの鍵を含むRPPairing形式plistを使ってください。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ungültige RPPairing-Datei oder UDID. Geräte-plist mit identifier und 32-Byte-Schlüsseln verwenden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivo o UDID no válido. Usa el plist RPPairing propio con identifier y claves de 32 bytes."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fichier ou UDID invalide. Utilisez le plist RPPairing propre avec identifier et clés de 32 octets."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"RPPairing 파일 또는 UDID가 올바르지 않습니다. identifier와 32바이트 키가 있는 이 기기의 plist를 사용하세요."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"RPPairing文件或UDID无效。请使用此设备含identifier及32字节密钥的plist。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"RPPairing檔案或UDID無效。請使用此裝置含identifier及32位元組金鑰的plist。"}}}},
    "local_vpn_step": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 · Enable a local tunnel"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 · ローカルトンネルを接続"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 · Lokalen Tunnel aktivieren"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 · Activar túnel local"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 · Activer le tunnel local"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 · 로컬 터널 연결"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 · 启用本地隧道"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2 · 啟用本機隧道"}}}},
    "local_vpn_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Install LocalDevVPN, allow its VPN configuration and connect. Return to MochiLog with the device unlocked. Default diagnostic endpoint: 10.7.0.1. Existing Tailscale users can use a compatible own-device reflector route instead."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LocalDevVPNを導入してVPN設定を許可し、接続します。ロック解除した状態でMochiLogに戻ってください。標準の診断接続先は10.7.0.1です。Tailscale利用者は、この端末へ戻す対応リフレクターの経路でも利用できます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LocalDevVPN installieren, VPN-Konfiguration erlauben und verbinden. Entsperrt zu MochiLog zurückkehren. Standard: 10.7.0.1. Mit Tailscale ist auch ein kompatibler Reflektor zum eigenen Gerät möglich."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instala LocalDevVPN, permite su configuración y conecta. Vuelve a MochiLog con el dispositivo desbloqueado. Dirección: 10.7.0.1. Tailscale también admite un reflector compatible al propio dispositivo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installez LocalDevVPN, autorisez le VPN et connectez-vous. Revenez à MochiLog déverrouillé. Adresse : 10.7.0.1. Tailscale peut aussi utiliser un réflecteur compatible vers ce même appareil."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LocalDevVPN을 설치하고 VPN을 허용한 뒤 연결하세요. 잠금 해제 후 MochiLog로 돌아오세요. 기본 주소는 10.7.0.1입니다. Tailscale 사용자는 자기 기기로 반환하는 호환 리플렉터도 사용할 수 있습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安装LocalDevVPN并允许VPN配置后连接。解锁设备后返回MochiLog。默认地址10.7.0.1。Tailscale用户也可使用返回本设备的兼容反射器路由。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安裝LocalDevVPN並允許VPN設定後連線。解鎖裝置後返回MochiLog。預設位址10.7.0.1。Tailscale使用者也可使用返回本裝置的相容反射器路由。"}}}},
    "local_open_vpn": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open LocalDevVPN"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LocalDevVPNを開く"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LocalDevVPN öffnen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abrir LocalDevVPN"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ouvrir LocalDevVPN"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LocalDevVPN 열기"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打开LocalDevVPN"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟LocalDevVPN"}}}},
    "local_address": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Local diagnostic endpoint"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"端末に戻す診断接続先"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lokaler Diagnose-Endpunkt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dirección de diagnóstico local"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Adresse du diagnostic local"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기기로 반환하는 진단 주소"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"返回设备的诊断地址"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"返回裝置的診斷位址"}}}},
    "local_vpn_caution": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MochiLog does not change or disconnect your VPN. Some VPN combinations cannot run together. If the tunnel is unavailable, computer collection keeps its own settings and can still be used."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MochiLogはVPNを勝手に変更・切断しません。VPNの組み合わせによっては併用できません。トンネルに接続できない場合でもPC経由の収集設定は保持され、利用できます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MochiLog ändert/trennt kein VPN. Einige VPNs lassen sich nicht kombinieren. Die Computererfassung bleibt unabhängig nutzbar."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MochiLog no modifica ni desconecta tu VPN. Algunas combinaciones no funcionan. La recopilación del ordenador permanece disponible."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MochiLog ne modifie ni ne déconnecte votre VPN. Certaines combinaisons sont incompatibles. La collecte ordinateur reste indépendante."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MochiLog는 VPN을 임의로 바꾸거나 끊지 않습니다. 일부 VPN 조합은 함께 작동하지 않습니다. PC 수집 설정은 유지됩니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MochiLog不会擅自更改或断开VPN。部分VPN无法并用。电脑收集设置保留且可独立使用。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"MochiLog不會擅自變更或中斷VPN。部分VPN無法並用。電腦收集設定保留且可獨立使用。"}}}},
    "local_collect_now": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collect now on this device"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この端末で今すぐ取得"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jetzt auf diesem Gerät erfassen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recopilar ahora en el dispositivo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collecter maintenant sur cet appareil"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 기기에서 지금 수집"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在此设备立即获取"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在此裝置立即取得"}}}},
    "local_working": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Authenticating and reading diagnostic logs…"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"認証して診断ログを取得中…"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diagnosezugang prüfen und Protokolle lesen…"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Autenticando y leyendo registros…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Authentification et lecture des journaux…"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"인증 및 진단 로그 수집 중…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在认证并读取诊断日志…"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在認證並讀取診斷日誌…"}}}},
    "local_limits": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Experimental · iOS/iPadOS 27. Reads run while MochiLog is open; unlock for files. Setup needs OS approval in Developer Mode settings. If no logs appear, check analytics sharing and generation. Background reads and operation with Developer Mode off are not guaranteed."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"実験機能・iOS/iPadOS 27。取得はMochiLogを開いている間に行い、ファイル収集にはロック解除が必要です。初回はデベロッパモードの設定でOSの承認を行います。ログがない場合は解析の共有と生成状況も確認してください。バックグラウンド取得やDeveloper Modeオフでの動作は保証していません。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Experimentell · iOS/iPadOS 27. Erfasst bei geöffneter App; für Dateien entsperren. Einrichtung erfordert OS-Zustimmung in Entwicklermodus-Einstellungen. Analysefreigabe und Protokollerzeugung prüfen. Hintergrund und deaktivierter Entwicklermodus nicht garantiert."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Experimental · iOS/iPadOS 27. App abierta y desbloqueada para archivos. Requiere aprobación del sistema en Modo de desarrollador. Comprueba análisis y generación de registros. No se garantiza segundo plano ni modo de desarrollador desactivado."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Expérimental · iOS/iPadOS 27. App ouverte et appareil déverrouillé pour les fichiers. Autorisation système dans Mode développeur requise. Vérifiez partage d’analyse et génération. Arrière-plan et mode développeur désactivé non garantis."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"실험 기능 · iOS/iPadOS 27. 앱이 열린 동안 수집하며 파일은 잠금 해제가 필요합니다. 개발자 모드 설정에서 OS 승인이 필요합니다. 분석 공유와 생성 여부를 확인하세요. 백그라운드 및 개발자 모드 끄기는 보장하지 않습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"实验功能 · iOS/iPadOS 27。应用打开时获取，文件需解锁。首次设置需在开发者模式中进行系统授权。请检查分析共享及日志生成。不保证后台或关闭开发者模式时可用。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"實驗功能 · iOS/iPadOS 27。App開啟時取得，檔案需解鎖。首次設定需在開發者模式中進行系統授權。請檢查分析共享及日誌生成。不保證背景或關閉開發者模式時可用。"}}}},
    "local_forget": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Remove on-device authentication"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"端末内の認証を削除"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geräteinternen Zugang entfernen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eliminar autenticación local"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Supprimer l’accès local"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"기기 내 인증 삭제"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"删除设备内认证"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"刪除裝置內認證"}}}},
    "local_forget_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Removes the local Keychain credential and turns off on-device collection. Computer pairings and saved battery records remain."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"端末内のKeychain認証情報を削除し、端末内取得をオフにします。PCのペアリングや保存した電池記録は保持します。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Entfernt den lokalen Keychain-Zugang und deaktiviert die Erfassung. Computer-Kopplungen und Einträge bleiben."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elimina la credencial del llavero y desactiva la recopilación local. Se conservan emparejamientos y registros."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Supprime l’accès du trousseau et désactive la collecte locale. Jumelages ordinateur et enregistrements conservés."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"로컬 Keychain 인증을 삭제하고 자체 수집을 끕니다. PC 페어링과 기록은 유지합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"删除本地钥匙串凭据并关闭设备内获取。电脑配对及已存记录保留。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"刪除本機鑰匙圈憑證並關閉裝置內取得。電腦配對及已存記錄保留。"}}}},
    "local_daily_wait": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatic collection is resting until another daily log is needed. Manual collection is available."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"次のログが必要になるまで自動取得を休止しています。手動取得は利用できます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Automatische Erfassung pausiert bis zum nächsten Tagesprotokoll. Manuelle Erfassung möglich."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La recopilación automática descansa hasta necesitar otro registro diario. La manual está disponible."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Collecte automatique en pause jusqu’au prochain journal nécessaire. Collecte manuelle disponible."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"다음 일일 로그가 필요할 때까지 자동 수집을 쉽니다. 수동 수집은 가능합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动获取暂停至需要新的每日日志。仍可手动获取。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動取得暫停至需要新的每日日誌。仍可手動取得。"}}}},
    "local_received": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d file(s) added to the import queue"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d件を取り込み待ちに追加しました"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d Datei(en) zum Import hinzugefügt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d archivo(s) en la cola"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d fichier(s) en attente"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d개 파일 가져오기 대기 중"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已将%d个文件加入导入队列"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已將%d個檔案加入匯入佇列"}}}},
    "local_connection_failed": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cannot read this device. Check the local tunnel, OS pairing and lock state. Pairing is not recreated automatically."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この端末を読み取れません。ローカルトンネル・OSペアリング・ロック状態を確認してください。自動で再ペアリングはしません。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gerät nicht lesbar. Tunnel, OS-Kopplung und Sperre prüfen. Keine automatische Neukopplung."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se puede leer. Comprueba túnel, emparejamiento y bloqueo. No se vuelve a emparejar automáticamente."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lecture impossible. Vérifiez tunnel, jumelage et verrouillage. Pas de nouveau jumelage automatique."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"읽을 수 없습니다. 로컬 터널, OS 페어링, 잠금 상태를 확인하세요. 자동 재페어링은 하지 않습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法读取。请检查本地隧道、系统配对和锁定状态。不会自动重新配对。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法讀取。請檢查本機隧道、系統配對和鎖定狀態。不會自動重新配對。"}}}},
    "local_source": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This device · local"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この端末・端末内取得"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dieses Gerät · lokal"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Este dispositivo · local"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cet appareil · local"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 기기 · 로컬"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此设备 · 本地"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此裝置 · 本機"}}}},

    "mt_guide_cloud_detail": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Devices paired with the same computer can receive each other’s logs only when both have iCloud sync enabled and the same Apple Account is confirmed. The source device identity is preserved. Sync off, different accounts or unconfirmed settings prevent sharing. If the source app has not been opened recently, sharing waits for confirmation."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"同じPCとペアリングした端末で、双方のiCloud同期がオン・同じApple Accountと確認できた場合だけ、ほかの端末のログも受信します。記録は元の端末の個体IDを保持します。同期オフ・別アカウント・未確認なら共有しません。共有元のアプリをしばらく開いていない場合は確認まで保留します。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mit demselben Computer gekoppelte Geräte erhalten gegenseitig Protokolle nur bei aktivierter iCloud-Synchronisierung auf beiden Geräten und bestätigtem gleichen Apple Account. Die Identität des Quellgeräts bleibt erhalten. Bei deaktivierter oder unbestätigter Synchronisierung oder verschiedenen Accounts wird nicht geteilt. Wurde die Quell-App länger nicht geöffnet, wird auf eine Bestätigung gewartet."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los dispositivos enlazados al mismo ordenador pueden recibir los registros de otros solo si ambos tienen la sincronización con iCloud activada y se confirma la misma cuenta de Apple. Se conserva la identidad del dispositivo de origen. No se comparten si la sincronización está desactivada, las cuentas difieren o falta confirmación. Si la app de origen lleva tiempo cerrada, se espera su confirmación."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les appareils jumelés au même ordinateur peuvent recevoir les journaux des autres uniquement si la synchronisation iCloud est activée sur les deux et si le même compte Apple est confirmé. L’identité de l’appareil d’origine est conservée. Aucun partage si la synchronisation est désactivée, les comptes diffèrent ou la confirmation manque. Si l’app source n’a pas été ouverte récemment, le partage attend sa confirmation."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"같은 PC와 페어링한 기기에서 양쪽 모두 iCloud 동기화가 켜져 있고 같은 Apple 계정으로 확인된 경우에만 다른 기기의 로그도 받습니다. 원래 기기의 개체 ID를 유지합니다. 동기화 끔, 다른 계정 또는 미확인 상태에서는 공유하지 않습니다. 원본 앱을 한동안 열지 않았다면 확인될 때까지 보류합니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"与同一电脑配对的设备，仅在双方均开启 iCloud 同步并确认使用同一 Apple 账户时，才能接收其他设备的日志。保留原设备的个体 ID。关闭同步、账户不同或未确认时不共享。若近期未打开来源应用，将等待确认后再共享。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"與同一電腦配對的裝置，僅在雙方均開啟 iCloud 同步並確認使用同一 Apple 帳號時，才能接收其他裝置的日誌。保留原裝置的個體 ID。關閉同步、帳號不同或未確認時不分享。若近期未開啟來源 App，將等待確認後再分享。"}}}},
    "mt_guide_cloud_title": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Logs from your other devices"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ほかの端末のログも受信"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Protokolle deiner anderen Geräte"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Registros de tus otros dispositivos"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Journaux de vos autres appareils"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"다른 기기의 로그도 수신"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接收其他设备的日志"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"接收其他裝置的日誌"}}}},
    "live_common": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Common values"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"共通の値"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gemeinsame Werte"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Valores comunes"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Valeurs communes"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"공통 값"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"共同值"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"共同值"}}}},
    "live_differences": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Differences between computers"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PCごとの差分"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unterschiede zwischen Computern"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Diferencias entre ordenadores"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Différences entre ordinateurs"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"컴퓨터별 차이"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"电脑之间的差异"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"電腦之間的差異"}}}},
    "live_sources": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sources and acquisition times"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"取得元と取得日時"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quellen und Abrufzeiten"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fuentes y horas de obtención"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sources et heures de lecture"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"출처 및 수집 시간"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"来源与获取时间"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"來源與取得時間"}}}},
    "live_compare_note": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Computers may read at different times. Missing values and stale readings are shown separately."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"PCごとに取得時刻が異なり、値に差が出る場合があります。未取得・古い値は取得元の状態で確認できます。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Computer können zu unterschiedlichen Zeiten abrufen. Fehlende und veraltete Werte werden separat angezeigt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Los ordenadores pueden leer en momentos diferentes. Se indican los valores no disponibles y antiguos."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les ordinateurs peuvent lire à des moments différents. Les valeurs absentes et anciennes sont indiquées séparément."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"컴퓨터마다 수집 시간이 다를 수 있습니다. 누락된 값과 오래된 값은 별도로 표시됩니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"各电脑可能在不同时间读取。未获取及过期的数据会分别标明。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"各電腦可能在不同時間讀取。未取得及過期的資料會分別標示。"}}}},
    "live_details_empty": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No additional fields were returned."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"追加の項目はありません。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Keine weiteren Felder zurückgegeben."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se recibieron campos adicionales."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aucun champ supplémentaire reçu."}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"추가 항목이 없습니다."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"没有返回其他项目。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"沒有傳回其他項目。"}}}},
    "live_Serial": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Battery identifier"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"バッテリー識別情報"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Akku-Kennung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Identificador de batería"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Identifiant de la batterie"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"배터리 식별 정보"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"电池标识信息"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"電池識別資訊"}}}},
