    "live_FullChargeCapacity": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Full charge capacity"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"満充電容量"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vollladekapazität"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Capacidad de carga completa"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Capacité de pleine charge"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"완충 용량"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"满充容量"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"充滿容量"}}}},
    "live_CurrentCapacity": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Charge level"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"充電残量"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ladestand"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nivel de carga"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Niveau de charge"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"충전 잔량"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"剩余电量"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"剩餘電量"}}}},
